ORDER i) The appeal is partly allowed;
S S Siddananjappa vs Nagaraju on 21 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/181721822/
4 ii) The petitioner is entitled to an enhanced compensation of Rs.94,000/- (Rupees Ninety Four Thousand only) along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition before the tribunal till realization, which shall be over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal.

